    <string name="key_capture_summary">Sends Win, Win+key and Alt+Tab to your computer while DeskLink shows it</string>
    <string name="key_capture_description">Android keeps Win, every Win+key combination and Alt+Tab for itself, so DeskLink cannot pass them to your computer. With this on, DeskLink receives the physical keyboard\'s keys first, but only takes them while a DeskLink session is on screen; at any other time every key goes to Android as usual. It reads no screen content and sends keys only to the computer you connected to.</string>
